WEBVTT


1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.420
How do you measure your life?

2
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.200
In time?

3
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.960
Or in heartbeats?

4
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.640
In standing still?

5
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.060
Or going with that bold decision?

6
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.300
In chances you didn't take?

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Or in experiences you did?

8
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.660
We live this one life.

9
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.980
We have this one chance.

10
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.780
When you look back,
what are you going to remember?

11
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:55.660
Make every heartbeat count.
